      "writtenOn": "2023-11-28T16:52:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we really need the bounds checks here giving it is also done at 7228? The hook handler can do this if it changes the value for `nice`. How about\n```\nif (!allowed)\n  goto out_unlock;\n```",
      "revId": "27afa66b1b8e439c5ecc4badeeffd7ee69378977",
