      "writtenOn": "2023-11-29T16:54:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, I agree that in this context, what `allowed` actually means is a bit confusing.\n\nhow about:\n```\n    trace_android_rvh_set_user_nice_locked(p, \u0026nice);\n    if (nice \u003c MIN_NICE)\n        goto out_unlock;\n```\nand the hook handler sets nice to MIN_NICE-1 or something like that to force a bail-out?",
      "parentUuid": "afc0045d_12fa8a24",
      "revId": "27afa66b1b8e439c5ecc4badeeffd7ee69378977",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
